              ['offering an infinite, constantly refreshed feed of the latest stories', 'This is the mechanism of digital news, the opposite view.'],
              ['offering a finite, curated selection that dictates identical opinions to every citizen without exception', 'Overstated: an edition sets shared priorities; it cannot dictate opinions to everyone.']
